/span><span begin="00:33.645" end="00:34.101">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.893" end="00:39.662"><span begin="00:37.893" end="00:38.101">Don't </span><span begin="00:38.101" end="00:38.285">tell </span><span begin="00:38.285" end="00:38.437">me </span><span begin="00:38.437" end="00:38.597">about </span><span begin="00:38.597" end="00:38.797">your </span><span begin="00:38.797" end="00:39.662">problems</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.349" end="00:42.208"><span begin="00:40.349" end="00:40.549">If </span><span begin="00:40.549" end="00:40.765">you're </span><span begin="00:40.765" end="00:40.975">not </span><span begin="00:40.975" end="00:41.176">trying </span><span begin="00:41.176" end="00:41.400">to </span><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:41.703">solve </span><span begin="00:41.703" end="00:42.208">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.083" end="00:44.341"><span begin="00:43.083" end="00:43.290">Don't </span><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.577">ask </span><span begin="00:43.577" end="00:43.704">me </span><span begin="00:43.704" end="00:43.848">for </span><span begin="00:43.848" end="00:44.002">my </span><span begin="00:44.002" end="00:44.341">help</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.563" end="00:49.509"><span begin="00:48.563" end="00:48.701">Fix </span><span begin="00:48.701" end="00:48.791">it </span><span begin="00:48.791" end="00:49.509">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.733" end="00:52.587"><span begin="00:50.733" end="00:50.989">She </span><span begin="00:50.989" end="00:51.173">tried </span><span begin="00:51.173" end="00:51.333">to </span><span begin="00:51.333" end="00:51.493">call </span><span begin="00:51.493" end="00:51.718">me </span><span begin="00:51.718" end="00:52.587">yesterday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.395" end="00:54.616"><span begin="00:53.395" end="00:53.553">But </span><span begin="00:53.553" end="00:53.712">I </span><span begin="00:53.712" end="00:53.898">didn't </span><